  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Offentlig upphandling, 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public procurement, 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att bist&#xe5; Ukraina i att utveckla ett system f&#xf6;r offentlig upphandling. Detta projekt best&#xe5;r av tre delprojekt: organisationsutveckling inom den ukrainska n&#xe4;mnden f&#xf6;r offentlig upphandling, st&#xf6;d till den ukrainska anbudsjournalen samt ett utbild- ningsprogram f&#xf6;r tj&#xe4;nstem&#xe4;n inom offentlig upphandling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to assist Ukraine in developing a public procurement system. The project consists of three components: organizational development within the public procurement office, support to the public procurement bulleting and a training programme for public procurement officers.</narrative>
  </description>
